{"v":4,"catch":"深刻的怪異！ 奇怪……但太棒了……","desc":"《BARADUKE》是NAMCO（Bandai Namco Entertainment）於1985年發行的動作遊戲。\n和平、友好的 PACCET 世界遭到邪惡 OCTY 的襲擊！\n穿過 PACCET 下方的地下 OCTY 堡壘 BARADUKE，並使用您的 Wave Gun 和 Shield 消滅 OCTY！\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2022-11-10","genres":["動作","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/621d88995bc2ec3f7ba9ed0aaee695f0f180507e6e5a847b06d60aeb2c6b4553.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/adb1114560815c08fbe11b06b5188f9a6cc9f556738ba8d7c669c2050fe5aa44.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/f55c3fd8dba827a4774b3db62edfa5fdf970a76b661e0d06db7aaf9e2109b494.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/e7365b411d15396013df5461ae0d48e3f8413e125aba697b6a657904fef9b6e0.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/53f9cc8ce1071c90e83f8591c7c9cb360c1ca2d231f1127de30bb5674d342786.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/54041c2f0a2c6fb8371852a6cdcf9ad1399611c9666e94e8244c931b70536018.jpg"],"titleId":"0100c34019218000","dlc":[]}